WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.075 --> 00:00:26.731
Cat hid in Tom's pocket.

2
00:00:26.732 --> 00:00:30.163
Dirk sank into a chair.

3
00:00:30.164 --> 00:00:34.558
"He looks sick," Tom thought.

4
00:00:34.559 --> 00:00:39.861
Then Dirk's daughter came in.

5
00:00:39.862 --> 00:00:42.987
She was carrying a tray.

6
00:00:42.988 --> 00:00:47.814
"Here's your milk and toast, Father," Ann said.

7
00:00:47.815 --> 00:00:54.435
Dirk clutched his stomach and moaned.

8
00:00:54.436 --> 00:00:59.327
"It's not easy being the head servant around here.

9
00:00:59.328 --> 00:01:07.508
Especially when a dragon attacks the palace!"

10
00:01:07.509 --> 00:01:12.317
Ann patted him on the shoulder.

11
00:01:12.318 --> 00:01:16.550
"Try some milk and toast.

12
00:01:16.551 --> 00:01:25.962
It's good for an upset stomach."

13
00:01:25.963 --> 00:01:28.139
Tom stepped forward.

14
00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:30.189
"Can I help?"

15
00:01:30.190 --> 00:01:33.518
"No!" Dirk glared at Tom.

16
00:01:33.519 --> 00:01:43.077
"My daughter should be the royal wizard. Not you!"

17
00:01:43.078 --> 00:01:46.047
"Father," Ann said softly.

18
00:01:46.048 --> 00:01:48.058
"I don't want to be the—"

19
00:01:48.059 --> 00:01:55.054
"You will be the royal wizard one day," Dirk snapped.

20
00:01:55.055 --> 00:01:58.281
"I have to get back to the roof," Dirk said.

21
00:01:58.282 --> 00:02:06.406
He put down his milk and left.

22
00:02:06.407 --> 00:02:12.469
Tom sighed. "Your father hates me."

23
00:02:12.470 --> 00:02:16.778
"He wants me to be the royal wizard," Ann said.

24
00:02:16.779 --> 00:02:20.746
"But you're a fine wizard, Tom."

25
00:02:20.747 --> 00:02:22.624
Tom shook his head.

26
00:02:22.625 --> 00:02:25.554
"No, I'm not."

27
00:02:25.555 --> 00:02:28.352
"Yes, you are," Ann said.

28
00:02:28.353 --> 00:02:31.302
"Show me a spell."

29
00:02:31.303 --> 00:02:37.611
"Okay." Tom waved his wand.

30
00:02:37.612 --> 00:02:42.806
Poof! Roses appeared.

31
00:02:42.807 --> 00:02:49.043
Tom grinned and gave them to Ann.

32
00:02:49.044 --> 00:02:53.763
"See?" she said. "Thank you."

33
00:02:53.764 --> 00:02:56.562
"You're welcome," Tom said.

34
00:02:56.563 --> 00:03:03.954
"Now I'm going to fight that dragon!"
